**8 declared entries, 7 retrievable OIDs, and only 4 of the 8 entries are retrievable at all.** The header declares every entry `HANDLER_CAN_RONLY`, but `snmp_moxa_mib/private/mxDeviceIo.mib` declares the four `index` columns `not-accessible` (poe:168, relay:258) or `accessible-for-notify` (systemPower:125, di:211) — under SMI neither may be returned by GET or GETNEXT. Only the four `*Status` columns are `read-only`. Walked on Build 2026_0805_1738:

