| `io/di/`, `io/relay/` | `"open"` / other | 0 / 1 | `open(0) short(1)` | `main.rs:240-253` |

All four URIs carry `IES_FLAG_SNMP_URI_STATUS` (`ies_auto_mibs_setup_net_mx_device_io.c`), so Task 6 touches the status layer only and never the config layer.

**`io/relay/` has a null row.** The status layer returns `[{"status":"open"},{"status":"open"},null]`. Serve two rows; the third has no status to convert. In-master publishes a third *index* value (`.2.4.1.1.3 = 3`) and no third status — an asymmetry that disappears once the index columns are not served.

